    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45150" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐσπάθητος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span></span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>closelywoven</i>, <i><span class="en">
